#!/bin/bash
# claude-screenshot - Screenshot → Claude Code OCR or Tailscale send
# Requires: GNOME/Wayland, wl-paste, zenity, notify-send
# Optional: claude CLI, tailscale, ssh/scp
#
# Usage:
#   claude-screenshot                    Interactive dialog
#   claude-screenshot --quick ["prompt"] Send to Claude with default/custom prompt
#   claude-screenshot --send DEVICE      Send to Tailscale device

set -euo pipefail

# Ensure claude CLI is reachable (not in PATH when launched from GNOME)
[[ -d "$HOME/.claude/local" ]] && export PATH="$HOME/.claude/local:$PATH"

DEFAULT_PROMPT="Extract all text from this image"
LOCAL_HOSTNAME=$(hostname)

die() { notify-send -i dialog-error "Claude Screenshot" "$1"; exit 1; }

# --- Grab image from clipboard ---

TMPFILE=$(mktemp /tmp/claude-screenshot-XXXXXX.png)
cleanup() { rm -f "$TMPFILE"; }
trap cleanup EXIT

if ! wl-paste --type image/png > "$TMPFILE" 2>/dev/null || [[ ! -s "$TMPFILE" ]]; then
    die "No image in clipboard.\nTake a screenshot with Print Screen first."
fi

# --- Helpers ---

send_to_claude() {
    local prompt="${1:-$DEFAULT_PROMPT}"
    notify-send -i dialog-information "Claude Screenshot" "Processing..."

    if ! command -v claude &>/dev/null; then
        die "claude CLI not found"
    fi

    local response
    response=$(echo "Read image '$TMPFILE'. Output ONLY raw text, no commentary. Task: $prompt" \
        | claude -p --model haiku --allowedTools "Read" --add-dir /tmp 2>&1) || true

    if [[ -z "$response" ]]; then
        die "No response from Claude"
    fi

    echo -n "$response" | wl-copy
    zenity --text-info \
        --title="Claude Screenshot (copied to clipboard)" \
        --width=700 --height=500 --font="monospace" \
        <<< "$response" 2>/dev/null || true
}

send_to_device() {
    local device="$1"
    local dest_dir="~/Downloads/$LOCAL_HOSTNAME"

    notify-send -i dialog-information "Claude Screenshot" "Sending to $device..."

    if ssh "$device" "mkdir -p $dest_dir" && scp -q "$TMPFILE" "$device:$dest_dir/"; then
        notify-send -i dialog-information "Claude Screenshot" "Sent to $device:$dest_dir/"
    else
        die "Failed to send to $device"
    fi
}

get_tailscale_peers() {
    # Returns active peer hostnames, one per line
    tailscale status 2>/dev/null \
        | grep -v "^$" \
        | grep -v "^#" \
        | awk '$5 == "active;" || $5 == "active" {print $2}' \
        | grep -v "^${LOCAL_HOSTNAME}$" \
        || true
}

# --- CLI modes ---

case "${1:-}" in
    --quick)
        send_to_claude "${2:-$DEFAULT_PROMPT}"
        exit 0
        ;;
    --send)
        [[ -z "${2:-}" ]] && die "Usage: claude-screenshot --send DEVICE"
        send_to_device "$2"
        exit 0
        ;;
    --help|-h)
        echo "Usage: claude-screenshot [--quick [prompt]] [--send DEVICE]"
        echo ""
        echo "  (no args)        Interactive dialog with Claude + Tailscale options"
        echo "  --quick [prompt] Send to Claude directly (default: extract text)"
        echo "  --send DEVICE    Send screenshot to Tailscale device via scp"
        exit 0
        ;;
esac

# --- Interactive mode ---

ZENITY_ITEMS=()

# Claude option (only if CLI available)
if command -v claude &>/dev/null; then
    ZENITY_ITEMS+=("claude" "Send to Claude Code (AI)")
fi

# Tailscale peers (only if tailscale available)
PEERS=$(get_tailscale_peers)
if [[ -n "$PEERS" ]]; then
    while IFS= read -r peer; do
        ZENITY_ITEMS+=("send:$peer" "Send to $peer (~/$LOCAL_HOSTNAME/)")
    done <<< "$PEERS"
fi

if [[ ${#ZENITY_ITEMS[@]} -eq 0 ]]; then
    die "No actions available.\nInstall claude CLI or tailscale."
fi

ACTION=$(zenity --list \
    --title="Claude Screenshot" \
    --text="What to do with this screenshot?" \
    --column="Action" --column="Description" \
    "${ZENITY_ITEMS[@]}" \
    --width=500 --height=400 \
    --hide-column=1 \
    2>/dev/null) || true

[[ -z "$ACTION" ]] && exit 0

case "$ACTION" in
    claude)
        PROMPT=$(zenity --entry \
            --title="Claude Screenshot" \
            --text="Prompt:" \
            --entry-text="$DEFAULT_PROMPT" \
            --width=500 2>/dev/null) || true
        send_to_claude "${PROMPT:-$DEFAULT_PROMPT}"
        ;;
    send:*)
        send_to_device "${ACTION#send:}"
        ;;
esac
